# Accepted exceptions to the image scan (Trivy, .github/workflows/ci.yml, ticket 71).
#
# CI fails a `main` build on any CRITICAL vulnerability that has a fix. Accept
# one here only when it cannot be fixed now (e.g. the fixed base image is not
# out yet) and it is not reachable in this app, and only for a short time:
#
#   # <why it is safe for now, who decided, and the ticket or link to follow>
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN exp:YYYY-MM-DD
#
# The reason is the `#` comment directly above the ID; `exp:` is required and
# at most 90 days out (the test enforces it). After that date Trivy stops ignoring it, the scan fails
# again and the exception must be looked at anew. tests/trivyignore.test.ts
# checks this format.
#
# No exceptions accepted so far.
